<% const projects = site_projects(); const labels={engineering:'AI 工程',research:'研究与数据',applications:'应用产品',resources:'学习资源'}; %>
<div class="site-container projects-page">
  <header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">BUILD / RESEARCH / SHARE</span><h1>项目与实践<span class="heading-period">.</span></h1><p>从想法到工具，从数据到证据。<br>这里是我的公开工作与持续探索。</p><div class="page-heading-meta"><span><%= projects.length %> 个公开项目</span><span class="status-dot"></span><span>仓库快照 <time><%= project_snapshot().slice(0,10) %></time></span><a href="https://github.com/sjkncs">GitHub <%- site_icon('arrow-up-right') %></a></div></header>
  <div class="project-toolbar"><div role="group" aria-label="项目分类" class="filter-tabs"><button type="button" data-category="all" aria-pressed="true">全部 <span><%= projects.length %></span></button><% Object.entries(labels).forEach(([key,label])=>{ %><button type="button" data-category="<%= key %>" aria-pressed="false"><%= label %></button><% }) %></div><div class="project-options"><label class="project-search"><%- site_icon('search') %><input type="search" id="project-search" placeholder="搜索项目" aria-label="搜索项目"></label><select id="project-sort" aria-label="项目排序"><option value="recent">最近更新</option><option value="stars">星标数量</option><option value="name">项目名称</option></select></div></div>
  <p class="results-count" id="project-count" role="status"><%= projects.length %> 个项目</p>
  <div class="project-grid" id="project-grid"><% projects.forEach(project=>{ %><article class="project-card" data-category="<%= project.category %>" data-name="<%= project.name %>" data-search="<%= (project.title+' '+project.name+' '+project.summary+' '+(project.language||'')).toLowerCase() %>" data-pushed="<%= project.pushed_at %>" data-stars="<%= project.stargazers_count %>"><div class="project-card-top"><span class="project-category"><%- site_icon(project.icon) %> <%= labels[project.category] %></span><a class="icon-link" href="<%= project.html_url %>" title="打开 <%= project.title %> 仓库" aria-label="打开 <%= project.title %> 仓库"><%- site_icon('arrow-up-right') %></a></div><h2><a href="<%= project.html_url %>"><%= project.title %></a></h2><p><%= project.summary %></p><div class="project-card-bottom"><span class="project-language"><span class="language-dot language-<%= (project.language||'docs').replace(/[^a-zA-Z]/g,'').toLowerCase() %>"></span><%= project.language||'资料索引' %></span><span class="project-stars"><%- site_icon('star') %> <%= project.stargazers_count %></span><time><%= project.pushed_at.slice(0,10) %></time></div></article><% }) %></div>
  <div id="project-empty" class="empty-state" hidden><%- site_icon('search-x') %><h2>没有匹配的项目</h2><button type="button" class="text-link" id="reset-projects">清除筛选 <%- site_icon('rotate-ccw') %></button></div>
  <section class="project-source"><%- site_icon('git-pull-request') %><p>项目描述人工维护，星标与推送日期由公开 GitHub 数据每日同步。仓库不等于全部原创、生产上线或研究结论成立。<a href="https://github.com/sjkncs/my-hexo-blog/actions/workflows/deploy.yml">查看同步状态</a></p></section>
</div>
